#               skips Firecrawl organic search (saves credits), much more accurate.
# Without SerpAPI: falls back to Firecrawl-only (slower, less accurate).
#
# Pricing:  $0     — 100 searches/month free  (covers ~33 items/month)
#           $50/mo — 5,000 searches/month     (covers ~1,600 items/month)
#           $130/mo— 15,000 searches/month    (covers ~5,000 items/month)
# Get key:  https://serpapi.com/manage-api-key
